The GenOffice document, spreadsheet, presentation and PDF components are adapted
to Lexora's isolated plugin environment. The file library, version management,
resource bridges and browser adapters are local modifications.

GenOffice uses Univer for spreadsheet rendering, Tiptap for document editing,
Konva for presentations, and PDF.js/PDFium/pdf-lib for PDF operations.
Third-party notices and bundled font licenses are included in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and the bundled assets.

No source code from the happy-friday-lite application is included.

The DOCX, XLSX, PPTX and PDF icons in src/office-home-icons.tsx are extracted
from apps/shell/src/renderer/src/assets/file-{docx,xlsx,pptx,pdf}.svg at the
GenOffice revision above. Their original geometry and colors are unchanged;
the local modification combines the four SVG files into a React component.

The homepage card, hero, filter and list styling in src/office.css is adapted
from the same GenOffice revision (apps/shell/src/renderer/src/home.css)
for Lexora document-library actions, themes and responsive layout.

